; @vite-pwa/astro 1.2.0 caps its astro peer dependency at ^5, but this project
; runs astro 7 (the integration is build-verified against 7). Tolerate that
; temporal peer cap so `npm ci` (CI) and `npm install` (the host deploy) resolve
; without a manual --legacy-peer-deps flag. Remove this once @vite-pwa/astro
; publishes a release whose astro peer range includes 7.
legacy-peer-deps=true
